.TH CFIMPORT 1 "January 2026" "cfimport 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cfimport \- Cloudflare Import Tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cfimport
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cfimport
is a command-line tool for importing and exporting Cloudflare configurations and resources.
It allows you to manage DNS records, firewall rules, and other Cloudflare settings from local files.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B dns
Import DNS records into a Cloudflare zone from various file formats (JSON, YAML, BIND, CSV).
.TP
.B firewall
Import firewall rules, WAF rules, rate limiting rules, or IP access rules.
.TP
.B export
Export Cloudflare configurations and resources to local files for backup or migration.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-config " " \fIFILE\fR
Path to configuration file (default: $HOME/.cfimport.yaml)
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Enable verbose output
.TP
.BR \-\-api\-token " " \fITOKEN\fR
Cloudflare API token (preferred authentication method)
.TP
.BR \-\-api\-key " " \fIKEY\fR
Cloudflare API key (legacy authentication)
.TP
.BR \-\-api\-email " " \fIEMAIL\fR
Cloudflare account email (required with --api-key)
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Show version information
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message
.SH DNS COMMAND OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-z ", " \-\-zone " " \fIZONE\fR
Cloudflare zone name or ID (required)
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-file " " \fIFILE\fR
Input file path (required)
.TP
.BR \-\-format " " \fIFORMAT\fR
Input file format: json, yaml, bind, csv (default: json)
.TP
.BR \-\-dry\-run
Preview changes without applying them
.TP
.BR \-\-replace
Replace existing records instead of merging
.SH EXAMPLES
Import DNS records from a JSON file:
.PP
.RS
cfimport dns --zone example.com --file dns-records.json
.RE
.PP
Import DNS records with dry-run:
.PP
.RS
cfimport dns --zone example.com --file records.json --dry-run
.RE
.PP
Export all zone configurations:
.PP
.RS
cfimport export --zone example.com --output ./backup/
.RE
.PP
Import firewall rules:
.PP
.RS
cfimport firewall --zone example.com --file rules.yaml
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CF_API_TOKEN
Cloudflare API token (preferred)
.TP
.B CF_API_KEY
Cloudflare API key (legacy)
.TP
.B CF_API_EMAIL
Cloudflare account email
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $HOME/.cfimport.yaml
User configuration file
.TP
.I /etc/cfimport/config.yaml
System-wide configuration file
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 1
General error
.SH AUTHOR
Sid Patel
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at: https://github.com/resolve109/cf-import/issues
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR curl (1),
.BR jq (1)
.PP
Cloudflare API documentation: https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/
